<p>The <strong class="selflink">TLK</strong> file is a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GFF" title="GFF">GFF</a> formatted file used to contain strings. They can be opened in the Toolset or the GFF Editor.
</p><p>Keep in mind that all numbers are in little-endian format if you are looking at the raw file.
</p><p>This may be incomplete, as I believe previous TLK files had timing info, etc as well.
</p>
